"""dani-ai — minimal BYOK chat CLI (OpenAI-compatible).

Single-shot:  dani-ai "question" [--system ...] [--model ...]
REPL:         dani-ai chat [--continue [NAME]]  (/save, /reset, ...)
List models:  dani-ai models
List tools:   dani-ai tools
List chats:   dani-ai history
Pipe:         cat f | dani-ai "summarize"
Custom tools: drop <name>.json manifests into ~/.config/daniwm/ai.tools/
