              --no-custom-tools disables it.
Key order:    --api-key > DANI_AI_API_KEY > OPENAI_API_KEY
              > DEEPSEEK_API_KEY > FREELLMAPI_API_KEY > VILAO_API_KEY
              > ~/.config/daniwm/ai.key (works when WM spawns without
              your shell env; chmod 600; lines: key, [api base], [model])
System order: --system > --system-file > DANI_AI_SYSTEM_FILE
              > ~/.config/daniwm/ai.system
Only stdlib. Streaming default on, --no-stream to disable.
"""
